## Model card

- **Name:** GPT Realtime Translate
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s streaming speech-to-speech translation model for live dialogue translation across spoken languages with simultaneous audio streaming (per local metadata).
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI realtime/translation stack. Local metadata lists `openai/gpt-realtime-translate`, 128K session context, and audio pricing tiers.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `gpt-realtime-translate`, `openai/gpt-realtime-translate`.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens total per session (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Audio and text input; audio and text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.05/min audio input, $0.20/min audio output (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary streaming speech-to-speech translation model. Architecture/parameter details not publicly disclosed.

